{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "offering", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I'm real estate sales trainer and I'm teaching you how to keep sane in this war market uncertainty and how using my nine strategies keep selling off plan.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:u000001"}], "text": "The video offers real estate agents strategies to continue selling off-plan in Dubai's uncertain market."}, "title": "Understanding Dubai Real Estate", "topic": "Dubai real estate"}, "content_hash": "cdf4361b0558fbc594e2c85305faf8e24a8759cfa4f28c644490df03b71f50f0", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:knowledge:63850cb28c9fe019", "metadata_hash": "7f846b6e734c4ff1c2f4068358c89bf00d4690bef4ef2963184240fe11ab6370", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-04-12", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c35664842cbdbc03b77be873fe4523036078f7da31d7275dbaf7bed6b5faa23c", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a3ZI3TpEaKc", "title": "Understanding Dubai Real Estate", "topic": "Dubai real estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [{"citations": [{"quote": "A lot of them, despite should be delivered in the end of twenty twenty six, which is this year, do have twenty five or thirty five percent completion.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:u000008"}], "text": "Projects claiming to be finished by the end of 2026 may have only 25% or 35% completion, with some even less."}], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:u000007", "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:u000008"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "The developer announced in one thing, which is supply on paper, but real delivery is completely different.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:u000007"}], "text": "Supply on paper announced by developers is often not the same as real delivery."}, "title": "Difference Between Supply on Paper and Real Delivery", "topic": "Dubai real estate"}, "content_hash": "cdf4361b0558fbc594e2c85305faf8e24a8759cfa4f28c644490df03b71f50f0", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:knowledge:f77f6c8cdb797eaa", "metadata_hash": "7f846b6e734c4ff1c2f4068358c89bf00d4690bef4ef2963184240fe11ab6370", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-04-12", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c35664842cbdbc03b77be873fe4523036078f7da31d7275dbaf7bed6b5faa23c", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a3ZI3TpEaKc", "title": "Difference Between Supply on Paper and Real Delivery", "topic": "Dubai real estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:u000009"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "The difference between on paper, which is announced and realistic, uh supply, which going to be handed over, is around forty percent. Forty percent less, not more, unfortunately.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:u000009"}], "text": "The difference between on-paper supply and realistic supply that will be handed over is approximately 40% less."}, "title": "Realistic Supply in Dubai's Market", "topic": "Dubai real estate"}, "content_hash": "cdf4361b0558fbc594e2c85305faf8e24a8759cfa4f28c644490df03b71f50f0", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:knowledge:43841fa8e97b7c03", "metadata_hash": "7f846b6e734c4ff1c2f4068358c89bf00d4690bef4ef2963184240fe11ab6370", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-04-12", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c35664842cbdbc03b77be873fe4523036078f7da31d7275dbaf7bed6b5faa23c", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a3ZI3TpEaKc", "title": "Realistic Supply in Dubai's Market", "topic": "Dubai real estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:u000023"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "If you're watching this video, you are an agent who wants to understand how to keep making money...they're running away. They already left Dubai, will be leaving in the next month or two.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:u000023"}], "text": "Agents who are confident in their capabilities will remain in Dubai, while those unsure will leave due to current instability."}, "title": "Real Estate in War Times", "topic": "Dubai real estate"}, "content_hash": "cdf4361b0558fbc594e2c85305faf8e24a8759cfa4f28c644490df03b71f50f0", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:knowledge:82e83c25b680dc5a", "metadata_hash": "7f846b6e734c4ff1c2f4068358c89bf00d4690bef4ef2963184240fe11ab6370", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-04-12", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c35664842cbdbc03b77be873fe4523036078f7da31d7275dbaf7bed6b5faa23c", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a3ZI3TpEaKc", "title": "Real Estate in War Times", "topic": "Dubai real estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:u000019"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "some project will be cancelled or delayed. The money will be returned to the buyers, right? So we are definitely not going to be seeing the supply that we were anticipating.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:u000019"}], "text": "Some projects will be cancelled or delayed, with money returned to buyers, reducing expected supply."}, "title": "Potential Project Delays", "topic": "Dubai real estate"}, "content_hash": "cdf4361b0558fbc594e2c85305faf8e24a8759cfa4f28c644490df03b71f50f0", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450:knowledge:10d7b400efa74a23", "metadata_hash": "7f846b6e734c4ff1c2f4068358c89bf00d4690bef4ef2963184240fe11ab6370", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-04-12", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "c35664842cbdbc03b77be873fe4523036078f7da31d7275dbaf7bed6b5faa23c", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-04-12-if-your-client-says-dubai-is-oversupplied-answer-this-a3zi3t-f1e5ec1450", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a3ZI3TpEaKc", "title": "Potential Project Delays", "topic": "Dubai real estate", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate"}
